==Battleground==
*1 [[Mini Angel Cyclone]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Li'l Zyclone]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Mesocosmocyclone]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mini Angel Cyclone]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Mini Angel Cyclone]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Welcome to Li'l Cyclone hell... except it's not actually that hard. Spam [[Ramen Cat|Ramen Cat]] for the first Mini Angel Cyclone, while using this time to build up money. Li'l Zyclone dies to [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] spam. When Mesocosmocyclone spawns, lure both Cyclones to your base and try to get [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] to Freeze Mesocosmo while you use units like [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Catcrates]] for the Mini Angel Cyclone. From there, it's just sending out generic counters for each Cyclone, like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] for the Mini White Cyclone. The only real hard part of this stage is just simple money management.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]]: Balrog shines on this stage, as he outranges every enemy. His Strengthen should be relatively simple to activate, as they all have high DPS and can push hard, after it is active, simply use the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]] to ensure he gets at least one big hit in.
*[[Daybreaker Izanagi (Legend Rare Cat)|Dawnbringer Izanagi]]: Izanagi similarly excels on this stage, dealing very high, Single Attack damage. To ensure you get the most out of him, you can Freeze enemies when he's about to attack or use his Conjure to create some distance.

