==Trivia==
*Given the American theme of [[Stratospheric Pathway]], Bubbly Dream's Japanese name, Baburī-kan Dorīmu (バブリー感ドリーム, "Bubbly-feeling Dream"), is likely a pun on ''Amerikan Dorīmu'' (アメリカンドリーム, [[wikipedia:American Dream|American Dream]]).

